  "question": {
    "text": "Two magnets of equal mass are joined at 90<math><mo>°</mo></math> each other as shown in figure. Magnet <math><msub><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mi>&nbsp;</mi><msub><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math> has a magnetic moment <math><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math> times that of <math><msub><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi>&nbsp;</mi><msub><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math>. The arrangement is pivoted so that it is free to rotate in horizontal plane. When in equilibrium, what angle should <math><msub><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mi>&nbsp;</mi><msub><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math> make with magnetic meridian?<br />\r<br />\r&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\qt0018_c8e0b47ab1c5.png\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width: 120px; height: 120px;\" />"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "75<math><mo>°</mo></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "60<math><mo>°</mo></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "30<math><mo>&deg;</mo></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "45<math><mo>°</mo></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "C"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "In equilibrium, the resultant magnetic moment will be along magnetic meridian. Let <math><msub><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math> make <math><mi>&ang;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&theta;</mi></math> with resultant<br /><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&theta;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi>M</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mo>&there4;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&theta;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn><mo>&deg;</mo></math>"
  }
